  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "mechanism",
      "text": "Silymarin, the active component of milk thistle, stabilizes cell membranes, reduces lipid peroxidation, scavenges free radicals, and enhances antioxidant defenses. It also modulates inflammatory pathways and may promote liver regeneration."
    },
    {
